## Choose a presentation

Start with inline UI and request more space only when the workflow needs it. Choose the smallest presentation that lets people understand the result or complete the task.

### Inline card

Use an inline card for a focused result, confirmation, or small set of actions. Keep it self-contained and avoid deep navigation.

